sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P1 as Organizer
    participant P2 as Web
    participant P3 as AI Design API
    participant P4 as Quota/advisory lock
    participant P5 as RabbitMQ worker
    participant P6 as Model/preview storage
    P1->>P2: Submit AI job
    P2->>P3: Check owner / quota
    P3->>P4: Persist and enqueue
    P4->>P5: Generate proposal
    P5->>P6: Store result / status
    P6-->>P1: Résultat / statut vérifié
